#etcsl: line-id=A.25

A.26. [... ur₅] uš₂-a [...] X |DU.DU|
#tr.en: I am a young man, I am knowledgeable,
#lem: X; ur[liver]; uš[die]; X; X; X
#etcsl: line-id=A.26

A.27. [...] mi-ni-in#-ŋar#
#tr.en: but what I know does not come out right with me.
#lem: X; ŋar[put]
#etcsl: line-id=A.27

A.28. ŋuruš-me-en zu-me-en [niŋ₂]-zu-ŋu₁₀ si nu-mu-da-sa₂-e
#tr.en: The truth which I speak has been turned (?) into a lie.
#lem: ŋuruš[young adult male]; zu[know]; niŋzu[knowledge]; si[horn]; sa[equal]
#etcsl: line-id=A.28

A.29. zid dug₄-ga-ŋu₁₀ lul-še₃ i₃-kur₉
#tr.en: A man of deceit has overwhelmed me like the south wind and prostrated me before him.
#lem: zid[right]; dug[speak]; lul[false]; kur[enter]
#etcsl: line-id=A.29

A.30. lu₂-lul-la-ke₄ u₁₈-lu mu-un-dul šu-kin mu-un-na-dab₅
#tr.en: My unwitting arm has shamed me before you. You have doled out to me suffering ever anew.
#lem: lulul[liar]; ulu[south wind]; dul[cover]; šukin[prostration]; dab[seize]
#etcsl: line-id=A.30

A.31. a₂ nu-zu-ŋu₁₀ ma-ra-pe-la₂-en
#tr.en: When I go into the house I despair.
#lem: a[arm]; zu[know]; pel[defile]
#etcsl: line-id=A.31

A.32. du-lum-ma ki gibil-gibil-la-bi saŋ-e-eš mu-e-rig₇
#tr.en: When I,
#lem: dulum[toil]; ki[place]; gibil[new]; saŋ[head]; rig[donate]
#etcsl: line-id=A.32

A.33. e₂-a u₃-mu-un-kur₉-re-en ur₅ mu-uš₂
#tr.en: a young man,
#lem: e[house]; kur[enter]; ur[liver]; uš[die]
#etcsl: line-id=A.33

A.34. ŋuruš-me-en sila-še₃ um-e₃-en šag₄ mu-un-sag₃
#tr.en: go out into the street, I am depressed.”}
#lem: ŋuruš[young adult male]; sila[street]; e[leave]; šag[heart]; sag[strike]
#etcsl: line-id=A.34

A.35. šul-me-en sipad zid-ŋu₁₀ mu-da-ib₂ igi erim₂ mu-un-du₈
#tr.en: @q{“My righteous shepherd has become angry with me,
#lem: šul[youth]; sipad[shepherd]; zid[right]; ib[angry]; igi[eye]; erim[enemy]; du[spread]
#etcsl: line-id=A.35

A.36. na-gada-ŋu₁₀ lu₂-erim₂ nu-me-en-na a₂ hul ma-kiŋ₂-kiŋ₂
#tr.en: a youth, and looked upon me with hostility.
#lem: nagada[herdsman]; luʾerim[evildoer]; e[speak]; a[arm]; hulu[bad]; kiŋ[seek]
#etcsl: line-id=A.36

A.37. dub₃-sa-ŋu₁₀ inim gen₆-na na-ma-ab-be₂
